    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46309" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suc-crispus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subc-</span></b> ), a, um, adj.,
